4
00:00:04,528 --> 00:00:07,698
Can't I be the only man that you are nice to and takes care of?

5
00:00:10,238 --> 00:00:11,938
I don't know what you mean by that...

6
00:00:13,038 --> 00:00:15,448
Gosh, this woman really doesn't get it.

7
00:00:18,548 --> 00:00:19,548
Right now,

8
00:00:20,818 --> 00:00:22,118
I'm confessing to you.

9
00:00:22,718 --> 00:00:25,688
Asking you to look at me, and only me.

10
00:00:28,888 --> 00:00:30,888
I'm saying I think I like you, Gyu Rim.

11
00:00:32,398 --> 00:00:33,398
Got it?

12
00:00:37,828 --> 00:00:38,838
Well...

13
00:00:40,638 --> 00:00:41,908
All of a sudden like this?

14
00:00:44,838 --> 00:00:46,008
Well, if you're going to fall for someone,

15
00:00:46,878 --> 00:00:48,608
it can happen in ten seconds.

16
00:00:49,578 --> 00:00:51,648
But I don't think this is a good idea.

17
00:00:54,878 --> 00:00:57,418
What's not a good idea? Why not?

18
00:00:58,288 --> 00:00:59,888
Are you angry with me right now?

19
00:01:01,628 --> 00:01:04,028
No, I'm not angry.

20
00:01:07,758 --> 00:01:09,528
Do you think our connection is just an ordinary one?

21
00:01:10,668 --> 00:01:14,098
Come on, think about it. Our six 60-dollar outfits.

22
00:01:15,038 --> 00:01:16,238
Out of six outfits, for three days in a row,

23
00:01:16,308 --> 00:01:18,408
what do you think the chances are of us wearing the same one?

24
00:01:18,778 --> 00:01:21,538
Okay, so one-sixth times one-thirty-sixth...

25
00:01:21,608 --> 00:01:24,448
That's 1 in 216. On top of that, the same time,

26
00:01:24,508 --> 00:01:26,618
the same bus, and the same part-time job.

27
00:01:26,618 --> 00:01:28,588
Isn't this incredible fate amazing?

28
00:01:33,658 --> 00:01:37,428
And just so you don't get the wrong idea, let me add this.

29
00:01:38,058 --> 00:01:40,058
I'm not the kind of guy to just fall for anyone and confess,

30
00:01:40,128 --> 00:01:41,428
fall for them, confess, and come on so strong.

31
00:01:42,068 --> 00:01:43,298
I'm not that kind of guy.

32
00:01:44,628 --> 00:01:47,268
If I don't confess my feelings to you right now,

33
00:01:48,238 --> 00:01:53,038
I really feel like I'll lose you, and my heart is pounding like crazy.

34
00:01:53,238 --> 00:01:55,048
I really had to work up the courage for this.

35
00:01:56,978 --> 00:01:59,618
I'm not asking for an answer right now.

36
00:02:00,178 --> 00:02:02,688
Take your time and think it over.

37
00:02:03,848 --> 00:02:05,588
"Hey, if I were to date..."

38
00:02:06,818 --> 00:02:08,428
"with this guy,"

39
00:02:08,988 --> 00:02:10,458
"it might be kind of fun."

40
00:02:11,058 --> 00:02:12,398
If a thought like that crosses your mind,

41
00:02:13,228 --> 00:02:14,698
just let me know anytime.

42
00:02:15,298 --> 00:02:16,298
Okay?

43
00:02:19,738 --> 00:02:21,068
I'll tell you now.

44
00:02:23,538 --> 00:02:27,108
I'm really grateful you think so highly of me.

45
00:02:28,138 --> 00:02:31,578
But right now, I don't have the time or energy for a relationship,

46
00:02:31,918 --> 00:02:34,518
and I'm just not in the right state of mind for one.

47
00:02:40,958 --> 00:02:43,658
- Are you rejecting me? - Yes.

48
00:02:44,458 --> 00:02:46,498
- Just like that, right away? - Yes.

49
00:02:46,558 --> 00:02:47,658
So bluntly?

50
00:02:48,298 --> 00:02:49,528
Without even thinking about it?

51
00:02:50,368 --> 00:02:53,098
I'm sorry. I'm truly sorry.

52
00:02:53,698 --> 00:02:54,968
I'm sorry.

53
00:03:09,918 --> 00:03:12,318
Why say you're sorry three times?

54
00:03:13,358 --> 00:03:14,718
You're just making me feel more pathetic.

55
00:03:48,858 --> 00:03:50,458
- Hello. - Hello.

56
00:03:51,488 --> 00:03:53,158
- Can I order now? - Excuse me.

57
00:04:03,808 --> 00:04:04,808
Excuse me.

58
00:04:05,508 --> 00:04:07,908
- Hey. - Oh, yes.

59
00:04:08,408 --> 00:04:10,708
- Is there something you need? - Please clean this up.

60
00:04:10,778 --> 00:04:11,778
Okay.

61
00:04:24,688 --> 00:04:28,028
If you do this one more time, I will file a formal complaint.

62
00:04:33,038 --> 00:04:34,898
See? Told you.

63
00:04:36,138 --> 00:04:38,208
Her skin looks so soft.

64
00:04:38,438 --> 00:04:40,308
She said she'll file a formal complaint...

65
00:04:40,378 --> 00:04:41,378
