66
00:04:41,778 --> 00:04:44,908
- Deny it. Dude, your first time? - Are you okay?

67
00:04:46,548 --> 00:04:49,548
- Did he touch your hand? - Next time we call her over,

68
00:04:49,618 --> 00:04:52,288
